            "review_title": "Review at Ongbalo Quan",
            "review_text": "Harry F\n4 contributions\n0\nMy favourite bar in Da Nang, maybe Vietnam\nSep 2019 • Friends\nOngbalo is everything I want in a bar. It’s tucked away in a small neighbour, so it’s always relaxed and peaceful, even during its busier hours. The staff are attentive and will ensure you find the beer that you want or recommend you something new if you’re feeling adventurous. It’s a fantastic space, a ruin bar that resembles a junk shop, and that is definitely a compliment! Go for the extensive Vietnamese craft selection, stay for the multitude of delicious bar snacks. A must visit for all craft beer enthusiasts\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 25, 2020",
